        {"zh": "飞过腐化真菌，我越飞越壮。", "en": "Over the corrupted fungi, I grow bolder."},
        {"zh": "四只一群，我们在林子里绕。", "en": "Four or five of us circle through the wood."},
        {"zh": "蜂巢裂了，我换棵菌树。", "en": "My hive split, so I take another fungal tree."},
        {"zh": "腐肉的味道在前头，我过去。", "en": "Rot-flesh scent ahead. I'm going."},
        {"zh": "翅膀沾了孢子，沉了一点。", "en": "Spores cling to my wings, weighing them down."}
      ]
